<title>FINLAND: BIRKA LINE SWINGS TO 8-MTH PROFIT.</title>
<headline>BIRKA LINE SWINGS TO 8-MTH PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, tax    49.0 vs 2.9 loss</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinaries, tax   20.6 vs 12.6 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	     8.1 vs 7.0 loss/shr</p>
<p> Net sales				   266.3 vs 264.5</p>
<p> Operating profit			   34.9 vs 7.2</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation 83.2 vs 41.7</p>
<p> Net financial items	     charge 14.3 vs 19.8 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		 gain 28.4 vs 12.1 gain</p>
<p> Minorities				    nil vs 2.4 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					   3.2 vs nil</p>
<p> Net profit				   45.8 vs 2.9 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish shipping company is Birka Line</p>
<p>Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
